{
  "_comment": [
    "Locale registry for the local-news monitor.",
    "",
    "The query terms ARE the local knowledge — this file is the reason the",
    "monitor works at all. 'cremation ceremony Bali' returns almost nothing;",
    "'ngaben' returns hundreds. Terms are authored and verified per locale,",
    "then frozen. They are deliberately NOT generated per run: an LLM can",
    "propose candidates for a new locale, but a human keeps or kills them once",
    "and the result lives here.",
    "",
    "tier controls refresh frequency and therefore cost:",
    "  a  every 6 hours  — dense tourism, dense catalogue",
    "  b  daily",
    "  c  weekly",
    "",
    "Every locale in this file has been checked for real hits in the previous",
    "seven days. Anything that could not clear that bar was dropped rather than",
    "shipped empty — see verified_at and recent7d.",
    "Dropped after verification: ET (Ethiopia) — 1 relevant article in 30 days across six Amharic and English query variants. Google News has no usable Ethiopian corpus; shipping it would be a feed that is permanently empty."
  ],
